{"about_the_game":"Save your best friend Kevin from the evil Block Head! Unique enemy mechanics and huge bosses stand in your way. Keep the ball air-born while you kick your way through sprawling levels. Expanding hacky-sacks primary concept: keep the ball up with your arsenal of crazy kicks... or DIE!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE HACKY-SACK PLATFORMER</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1241230/extras/0db6790b16d9284bd265b2961cbe4595.poster.avif?t=1669389757\" width=610 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1241230/extras/0db6790b16d9284bd265b2961cbe4595.webm?t=1669389757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1241230/extras/0db6790b16d9284bd265b2961cbe4595.mp4?t=1669389757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE KICKING MECHANICS</strong></h2>\tKICK JUMP RUN = Simple controls with huge depth. Intuitive button combinations lead to amazing stunts and tricks. Flip, Slide, Charge-up and explore the insane depth of controls.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ANYONE CAN HACK IT</strong></h2>\tDONT WORRY. Beginners can learn to kick at their own pace with instant re-spawns and lots of checkpoints. Accessibility options allows players to play their way. Anyone can kick and KICKING STUFF IS FUN!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESIGNED FOR SPEED-RUNNERS</strong></h2>\tSKILLS. Veteran players can showcase their skills with amazing acrobatics and blazing fast kicks. Use your speed-multiplying bicycle flip-kick to build momentum and long jump to fly across stages.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"06a4d00e2ee3df394c86c110152a1b61c5e2bfe6.jpg","localized_name":"Air Slide Flip Out","name":"Air Slide Flip Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/